  "description": "We're in our light and bright era so only a salad will do! With our smokey All-American spice blend on the menu, these chickpeas are getting a real flavour kick. Toss them in a Dijon-laced salad and serve them up with some avocado, fetta cubes and garlic yoghurt, for a meal that nips that salad craving in the bud!",
