  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Slice brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Place chickpeas and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with All-American spice blend, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6870978d5a587f17f4583fcd/step-7f66cc00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and thinly slice.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave garlic with a drizzle of olive oil in 10 second bursts until fragrant. Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6870978d5a587f17f4583fcd/step-8f348a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once chickpeas are done, in a large bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, tomato, cucumber, Dijon mustard, a squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6870978d5a587f17f4583fcd/step-7b850b20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide salad between bowls.\n• Top with All-American roast chickpeas and avocado.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes and drizzle with garlic yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6870978d5a587f17f4583fcd/step-b31fad30.jpg"
    }
  ]
